cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Loaded CMJ System Identification"
message: "If you use this software, please cite this version."
type: software
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Loaded CMJ System Identification in MuJoCo: a fixed-20-kg, full-morphology
  mechanics-first system-identification study with bilateral force-platform
  measurements, bar-mounted linear-position transducer kinematics, deterministic
  synthetic trials, validation, and MakeHuman scientific visualization.
authors:
  - name: "Loaded CMJ research contributors"
